      "releaseNotes": "• Search and filter listings by Tesla option codes — on main search, local vehicles, and alerts\n• Option code picker with search, so you can find factory options without memorizing codes\n• Cleaner filter UI with clearer active-filter counts across search pages\n• Saved filter profiles now remember exterior/interior colors and your EAP include preference\n• Vehicle specs report shows clearer battery capacity information\n• Alerts run more often and deliver more reliably, with improved notification handling\n• Fixes for search text behavior, the Clear All filters button, and first-launch issues",
